# One line away from aa-counter-guard: the closing window opens at 3x
# dominance (the flame-family's measured setting, latched on CLOSE_HOLD
# sustained samples). The 120-pair panels (log 2026-09-01) measured the
# champion winning ONLY by counter-attrition -- zero marches in all 240
# matches -- with 48 survivors, 32 of them ahead or actively finishing at
# the sample limit while issuing MORE attack orders than winners. A decided
# match is won by ending it while it is decided; this arm asks whether the
# already-built latch converts that class at Hard.

